===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|brust|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*brusts}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*bʰrews-||to swell, blow, inflate}}. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|borst}}, English {{m|en|breast}}, Danish {{m|da|bryst}}, Swedish {{m|sv|bröst}}.

